# Environment variables live next to each app:
#   apps/api/.env.example     → copy to apps/api/.env          (server: HOST, PORT, NODE_ENV, DATABASE_URL)
#   apps/mobile/.env.example  → copy to apps/mobile/.env.local (app: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL)
# Never put passwords, access tokens, or private keys in any .env.example.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are bundled into the app and are public.
